# The playable tests of GludioWizardStand's hooks: a monster (20999, bound to no behavior)
# hitting a clan mate of Aden's standing wizard (35249), the knight (35235), calls the wizard
# for nothing, even on a winning draw: only a player's or a summon's hit makes it cast.
character Hunter 20
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioWizardStand
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioHold.GludioHold
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioHold.GludioKnight
npc knight 35235 SiegeGuard 1500 150 0 walks clan aden_siege_clan 300
npc wizard 35249 SiegeGuard 1500 0 0 walks clan aden_siege_clan 300 skill DD_MAGIC 4114 1
npc monster 20999 Monster 1600 0 0

hit knight 22 by monster
  desires wizard -
  desires knight attack(monster)=50
